  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PIMS-9537 URU/24/G31 PPG Towards a more circular Uruguay</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Towards a more circular Uruguay (Uruguay + Circular). As described in the project concept, this project aims to strengthen institutional and legal capacities and financial instruments for the transition to a circular economy, to apply circular models, including financial instruments, to food, plastics, vehicles, construction value chains with a socioinclusive approach and to disseminate knowledge and information to all stakeholders in the whole society to promote sustainable consumption and production pattern</narrative>
  </description>
